==Battleground==
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns.
**4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**2 [[Winged Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Do your best to kill the first Mr. Mole before hitting the base, then make sure to have a solid line of meatshields and do your best to take out either Winged Pigge or Mr. Mole as fast as possible. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and something with Long Distance will do a good job. Stacking [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cats]] while stalling Mr. Mole and killing Gabriels with [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] is a great idea to stall out the Winged Pigges and destroy the base.

As for 4 Crown restrictions, a rather effective strategy is to first use carefully-spawned Ramen Cats and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] to stall the Mr. Mole for max money and Worker level. After hitting the base, lure the two Winged Pigges to your side of the field, bursting them down with talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] + Thunderbolt Cannon and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to remove them from the field before the Mr. Moles catch up and cause trouble. [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] can also help to kill Winged Pigge Faster, while [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can be used to clear the way of Trolly Bloggers and Gabriels for your other attackers.

